{"duration": 54.929, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Thomas Edison slammed a tiny carbon button into his telegraph.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.484}, {"beat": 0, "text": "He hoped the speck could carry a voice across town.", "start": 3.704, "end": 6.023}, {"beat": 1, "text": "His lab mates scoffed, insisting the steel diaphragm was sufficient.", "start": 6.443, "end": 10.075}, {"beat": 1, "text": "They warned him he\u2019d waste time on a useless gimmick.", "start": 10.295, "end": 12.726}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Early telephone calls were faint, often disappearing mid\u2011sentence.", "start": 13.146, "end": 16.688}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Customers complained they could barely hear each other.", "start": 16.908, "end": 19.426}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Edison tightened the button, pressed the granules harder, and tried again.", "start": 19.646, "end": 23.176}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Each tweak made the signal a little louder.", "start": 23.396, "end": 25.26}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like whispering into a tin can.", "start": 25.68, "end": 27.919}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Versus shouting through a megaphone.", "start": 28.139, "end": 29.907}, {"beat": 4, "text": "When sound hits the thin diaphragm, it squeezes carbon granules.", "start": 30.327, "end": 33.93}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The pressure lowers the granules\u2019 electrical resistance.", "start": 34.15, "end": 36.984}, {"beat": 4, "text": "A steady current then varies, creating a strong electric pulse.", "start": 37.204, "end": 40.501}, {"beat": 4, "text": "That pulse travels the whole line without extra batteries.", "start": 40.721, "end": 43.77}, {"beat": 5, "text": "That tiny button let phones ring miles on a single wire.", "start": 44.19, "end": 47.066}, {"beat": 5, "text": "It became the standard for a whole century of telephony.", "start": 47.286, "end": 49.98}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Even after vacuum tubes arrived, the carbon transmitter still ruled.", "start": 50.2, "end": 53.809}], "words": [{"w": "Thomas", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.47, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Edison", "start": 0.52, "end": 1.12, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "slammed", "start": 1.245, "end": 1.545, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.57, "end": 1.62, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "tiny", "start": 1.695, "end": 2.02, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "carbon", "start": 2.07, "end": 2.42, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "button", "start": 2.47, "end": 2.67, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "into", "start": 2.695, "end": 2.845, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "his", "start": 2.87, "end": 2.945, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "telegraph.", "start": 2.995, "end": 3.6, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "He", "start": 3.769, "end": 3.844, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "hoped", "start": 3.894, "end": 4.119, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "the", "start": 4.144, "end": 4.194, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "speck", "start": 4.244, "end": 4.494, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "could", "start": 4.544, "end": 4.619, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "carry", "start": 4.669, "end": 4.919, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 4.969, "end": 4.994, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "voice", "start": 5.044, "end": 5.294, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "across", "start": 5.344, "end": 5.644, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "town.", "start": 5.694, "end": 6.093, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "His", "start": 6.508, "end": 6.658, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "lab", "start": 6.708, "end": 6.958, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "mates", "start": 7.008, "end": 7.233, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "scoffed,", "start": 7.283, "end": 7.958, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "insisting", "start": 8.008, "end": 8.458, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "the", "start": 8.483, "end": 8.533, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "steel", "start": 8.583, "end": 8.808, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "diaphragm", "start": 8.858, "end": 9.383, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "was", "start": 9.408, "end": 9.483, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "sufficient.", "star